    {
      "id": "arrival",
      "title": "Otaru",
      "kind": "intro",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{小樽|おたる}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "おたる"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Otaru"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Otaru is a historic port city on the Sea of Japan coast. Its canal and historic warehouses make it one of Hokkaido's recognizable destinations."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Look at the name:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "小"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**しょう / ちいさい**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "small"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "樽"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**たる**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "barrel"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Together:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{小樽|おたる}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**おたる**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Otaru"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "inside_otaru",
      "title": "Inside 小樽",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Look inside the name of {小樽|おたる}. Each kanji can be broken into parts - and parts are clues."
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_小",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_樽",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "radicalRef",
          "id": "radical_shou"
        },
        {
          "type": "radicalRef",
          "id": "radical_ki"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "text": "小 is its own radical. 樽 carries 木 (wood) - the same component you met in 札. Barrels were made of wood. Components are clues, not magic definitions.",
          "tone": "tip"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_02",
      "title": "小",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "小"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "ちいさい"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**chiisai**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "small"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You will encounter this word often."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{小さい|ちいさい}{町|まち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ちいさい まち**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**chiisai machi**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "small town"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notice:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**{小さい|ちいさい}**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "is a Japanese adjective."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We will build more adjectives throughout the Journey."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_小さい"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_03",
      "title": "The Week Begins with 日",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{日|ひ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "にち / ひ / か"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The character originally relates to the sun."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It can mean:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "sun / day"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Now combine it with:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{曜日|ようび}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ようび**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "day of the week"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{日曜日|にちようび}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**にちようび**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Sunday"
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_日",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "vocabRef",
          "id": "vocab_曜日"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_04",
      "title": "The Seven Weekday Kanji",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Japanese weekday names use seven important kanji:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{月|つき}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**げつ**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Monday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{火|ひ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**か**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Tuesday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{水|みず}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**すい**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Wednesday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{木|き}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**もく**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Thursday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{金|かね}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**きん**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Friday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{土|つち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ど**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Saturday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{日|ひ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**にち**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Sunday"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Add:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{曜日|ようび}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**ようび**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "and you get:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{月曜日|げつようび}\n{火曜日|かようび}\n{水曜日|すいようび}\n{木曜日|もくようび}\n{金曜日|きんようび}\n{土曜日|どようび}\n{日曜日|にちようび}"
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_月",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_火",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_水",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_木",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_金",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_土",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_05",
      "title": "Why These Kanji?",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The weekday characters correspond to traditional associations:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{月|つき}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "moon"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{火|ひ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "fire"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{水|みず}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "water"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{木|き}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "wood/tree"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{金|かね}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "metal/gold"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{土|つち}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "earth"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{日|ひ}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "sun"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a beautiful example of kanji carrying meaning even inside everyday words."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_06",
      "title": "What Day Is It?",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{今日|きょう}は{何曜日|なんようび}ですか。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**きょうは なんようびですか。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Kyō wa nan-yōbi desu ka?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "What day is it today?"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{月曜日|げつようび}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**げつようびです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Getsuyōbi desu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "It's Monday."
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "sentenceRef",
          "id": "sent_hokkaido_otaru_weekday"
        },
        {
          "type": "sentenceRef",
          "id": "sent_hokkaido_otaru_monday"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_07",
      "title": "何",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 1,
          "text": "{何|なに}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "なに / なん"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**nani / nan**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "what"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You have just seen:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{何曜日|なんようび}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**なんようび**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "what day of the week?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is an important N5 question word."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You will encounter:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{何|なに}ですか\nWhat is it?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{何人|なんにん}\nHow many people?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{何時|なんじ}\nWhat time?"
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "kanjiRef",
          "id": "kanji_何",
          "show": [
            "meaning",
            "readings",
            "components"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_08",
      "title": "Otaru Sentence",
      "kind": "content",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{小樽|おたる}は{北海道|ほっかいどう}の{町|まち}です。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**おたるは ほっかいどうの まちです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Otaru wa Hokkaidō no machi desu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Otaru is a city in Hokkaido."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "And:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "{小樽|おたる}はきれいです。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**おたるは きれいです。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Otaru wa kirei desu.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "quote",
          "text": "Otaru is beautiful."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here we introduce a **な-adjective**:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "きれい"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "beautiful / clean"
        },
        {
          "type": "divider"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Connected knowledge"
        },
        {
          "type": "sentenceRef",
          "id": "sent_hokkaido_otaru_location"
        },
        {
          "type": "sentenceRef",
          "id": "sent_hokkaido_otaru_beautiful"
        },
        {
          "type": "grammarRef",
          "id": "grammar_na_adjective"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "card_09",
      "title": "Mini Question",
      "kind": "practice",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Which one means Wednesday?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A. {月曜日|げつようび}\nB. {火曜日|かようび}\nC. {水曜日|すいようび}\nD. {木曜日|もくようび}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Answer:"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "C — {水曜日|すいようび}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "things_to_remember",
      "title": "Things to Remember",
      "kind": "summary",
      "scroll": true,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Place"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{小樽|おたる} — おたる — Otaru"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Kanji"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "小 — small\n樽 — barrel"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Weekdays"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{月曜日|げつようび} — げつようび — Monday\n{火曜日|かようび} — かようび — Tuesday\n{水曜日|すいようび} — すいようび — Wednesday\n{木曜日|もくようび} — もくようび — Thursday\n{金曜日|きんようび} — きんようび — Friday\n{土曜日|どようび} — どようび — Saturday\n{日曜日|にちようび} — にちようび — Sunday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Vocabulary"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{今日|きょう} — きょう — today\n{何|なに} — なに / なん — what\n{曜日|ようび} — ようび — weekday"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Grammar"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**{今日|きょう}は{何曜日|なんようび}ですか。**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What day is it today?"
        }
      ]
    }
